Subject: [PATCH 1/2] nm-sim: SIM-NME' implies NM for every attack (PS10
 Theorem 174.8, PSV07 Corollary 1)

Prove FixedLengthPKScheme.nmSecure_of_simNMSecure. Helper modules under
NonMalleability/Simulation/: Generic (budget reduction, eager coins, until-bad
coupling, chunk maps), Hybrid (the hybrid oracle rImpl, histImpl, views,
acceptance rates), SimIND (sampler <m0,m1> -> m_beta, SIM adversary, D', D'',
real/ideal identities), SimINDGap (the real and ideal gaps).
